                                "sense_id": "ac274e80-cd65-379d-9c68-e1083f748243",
                                "text": "Inexpressibly tired of this anxious intricate search I threw myself down on the soft moss to rest for a while, but the fatigue conquered the fears of the lonely forest, and I cannot now tell how long I dozed."
                            }
